{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Presenting the Product", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Aiming High", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.  Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Summarizing Results", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Surveys are an effective way of collecting from current or prospective customers. After conducting a survey, it is important to gather all the information and summarize the responses.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here's some language you can use to summarize and interpret responses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I found that ...</li><li>I noted that ...</li><li>It was apparent that ...</li><li>It's obvious that ...</li><li>I'd say ...</li><li>It's clear that ...</li><li>It's evident that ...</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">I noted that</span>  people's impressions depended on their awareness of the company.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">It was apparent that</span> people liked the product.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">It's clear that</span> the company's objectives are unknown to the public.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">It's evident that</span> company lacks personal relations.</span><br/> <br/>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Passive of Modals Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "The passive voice is commonly used in English. We use the passive when the \u2018doer' (agent) of the action it not so important. We are not interested in knowing who did the action. Our attention is on the object.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here's some more information about the passive of modal verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol type=\"a\"><li>Modals: can / could + be + past participle  We use these forms to talk about present and past possibility. <br/> <span class=\"italic\">There so much that can be said based on the survey's results.</span> <br/><span class=\"italic\">It's clear that a company-consumer relationship could be emphasized.</span></li><li>Modals: must / should + be + past participle These forms are used to talk about necessity and advisability. <br/><span class=\"italic\">A new link with potential customers must be built on.</span> <br/><span class=\"italic\">The name should definitely be changed to something more appealing.</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\">All these ideas must be given careful thought before being implemented.</span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "strongly negative", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very bad or harmful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I found that people had strongly negative opinions of Holly's.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when discussing results.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "impression", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an idea of what something is like", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I noted that personal impressions of Holly's depended on people's awareness of the scandal.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "severely", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a serious manner", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's evident that Holly's has severely lacked PR until recently.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "apparent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "obvious or evident", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was apparent that they liked the product.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ambivalence", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the state of being uncertain or having mixed feelings", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd say everyone showed ambivalence about the name.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "customer satisfaction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the degree to which customers are happy with a product or service", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some mentioned that customer satisfaction might be Holly's new priority.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to build on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to continue to improve something that has already had some degree of success", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sounds like something that could be built on.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "profit-driven", "type": "name"}, {"content": "guided by the need to make money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People have seen Holly's as being no different than any other profit-driven business until this survey.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Search the Internet for a company that has been involved in a scandal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes on the key events that happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Summarize what happened in a report. (Use <span class=\"italic\">it's apparent that ...</span>, <span class=\"italic\">it's evident that ...</span>, etc.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use some examples of passive modals in the report.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the report aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I read about a scandalous company.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes about the events during the scandal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I summarize the information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I provide a rationale for the importance of certain ideas.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the report aloud.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can summarize an informational memo about the results of a survey", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about jobs and work ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can provide a rationale for the importance of certain ideas", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "When you are purchasing an item, do you base your decision solely on price?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How much of a factor is a company's reputation in your purchasing decisions?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "The Survey Results", "type": "free_type_text_area"}],