feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le14ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: A lot can be said based on the survey's results. Here's a summary. I found that people had strongly negative opinions of Holly's.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: This could be directly related to the scandal.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Correct. I noted that personal impressions of Holly's depended on people's awareness of the scandal.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: This should definitely be addressed by our rebranding team.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Absolutely. It was apparent that while they liked the product, they have no other impressions.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: A focus on building a relationship with our clients could be emphasized. It's obvious that we're lacking that.", "time": "100", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn8le14ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: True. I'd say everyone showed ambivalence about the name. It's clear that no one knows Holly's objectives besides making a good product and business profit.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: It's evident that Holly's had severely lacked PR until recently.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Is there anything positive?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. Some mentioned that customer satisfaction might be Holly's new priority.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Sounds like something that could be built on.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Yes. This new connection with consumers must be built on.", "time": "37000", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le14ob09re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I'm guessing the name should be changed.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. Something meaningful to consumers should be reflected.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Rebranding must be given priority.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Your objectives must be given careful thought. People have seen Holly's as being no different than any other profit\u00ad-driven business until this survey. I advise acting while they are thinking.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I feel like I have been handed an opportunity.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You might well have.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I need time to think, but let's meet again.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: One question, if I may. Why the name Holly's?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Holly Farmani, my late wife. I think her name should be rebranded after all this.", "time": "68500", "id": 2}]}}], "_data": [{"content": 1, "type": "template_override"}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}